# integrations (vendor features)

Architecture: [architecture.mdc](./architecture.mdc)

Отдельного `src/integrations/` **нет**. Vendor UI — плоские hyphenated features в `components/` или `blocks/` (page-level); SDK — в `providers/`.

## Куда класть

| Что | Путь | Публичный path |
| --- | ---- | -------------- |
| Yandex Maps UI | `blocks/yandex-map/` | `mosuk-ui/blocks/yandex-map` |
| Yandex Maps SDK | `providers/yandex-map/` | `mosuk-ui/providers/yandex-map` |
| Yandex Metrika SDK | `providers/yandex-metrika/` | `mosuk-ui/providers/yandex-metrika` |
| T-Bank Terminal UI | `components/tbank-terminal/` | `mosuk-ui/components/tbank-terminal` |
| T-Bank SDK | `providers/tbank/` | `mosuk-ui/providers/tbank` |

## Layout

Канон как у остальных features:

```
{layer}/{feature}/
├── index.ts
└── .partials/
```

- Components: `.partials/components|styles|…` (как input-otp/drawer)
- Providers: `.partials/` (provider, context) — как `providers/toasts`

## Разделение

| Слой | Ответственность |
| ---- | --------------- |
| `providers/{vendor-…}/` | Script load, context, API keys |
| `blocks/{vendor-…}/` / `components/{vendor-…}/` | Visual UI, markers, widgets (maps → blocks) |

## Props / CSS

- Config на provider (`provider.interface.ts`)
- Display на component (`component.interface.ts`)
- `@layer mosuk-ui`; vendor classes в module

## Skeleton

Feature `{Name}Skeleton` не создаём. Shimmer — `@/components/skeleton`.

## Эталоны

- UI + compound: `src/blocks/yandex-map/`
- SDK provider: `src/providers/yandex-map/`, `src/providers/tbank/`
